Your turn. Pause the video.

21
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,280
No. It must be more than 600.

22
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:54,080
Switch on lines 199 to 203: pins, clock, text line, and the light switched off.

23
00:01:54,580 --> 00:02:00,260
