26
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:20,960
Lines 248 and 249 apply them to the timer and the touch hardware.

27
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:27,540
Line 251 sets the timer to 200 thousandths of a second. It isn't started yet.

28
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:35,196
Line 253 lets the touch interrupt reach the processor. Line 254 turns the touch

