39
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:28,080
Line 337 starts one scan.

40
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:34,740
Lines 339 to 341 wait until the done flag rises. That's polling.

41
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:38,040
