42
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:44,320
Lines 345 to 353 repeat the same recipe for pad two.

43
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:49,940
Lines 355 and 356 tidy up the flags.

44
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:54,780
Switch on lines 383 to 405.

45
00:03:55,280 --> 00:04:02,160
