46
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:07,380
Lines 388 to 390 start a scan of pad one.

47
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:13,640
Lines 392 to 394 wait while a scan is in progress.

48
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:21,340
