57
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,680
So who toggles the light now?

58
00:05:12,180 --> 00:05:17,180
Your turn. Pause the video.

59
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:19,740
The handler, after each automatic scan.

60
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:25,807
Build and load with your hands off, press Reset, then touch pad E1. Holding on may

61
